1
00:01:07,095 --> 00:01:09,530
Titans, go!
ໄຕຕັນ, ໄປ!

2
00:01:45,732 --> 00:01:47,066
<i>♪ T-E-E-N ♪</i>
<i>♪ T E E N ♪</i>

3
